# This directory is the socket for trained brain weights.
#
# It is deliberately EMPTY of weights right now: the trained line was discarded
# on 2026-08-05 (the defence brains were not good enough — a turret, a sprayer,
# then a pacifist; docs/TRAINING-LOG.md runs 20-21) and the game flies the
# scripted attack run everywhere instead. A future candidate re-enters by being
# imported in src/game/brains.ts, named in brain-names.ts, and dropped here.
#
# This .gitkeep exists only so the empty directory is tracked: test/ai.test.ts
# reads it (`the weights directory is exactly what brains.ts imports`) and would
# crash on a missing directory rather than see zero .json files.
